 20028	         "when": ['\\bawait\\b', '\\.Result\\b', '\\.Wait\\(', 'GetAwaiter\\(', 'Task\\.Run', 'CancellationToken', 'Thread\\.Sleep', 'new Thread\\(', 'ThreadPool\\.QueueUserWorkItem', 'BackgroundWorker', '\\bWebClient\\b', '\\.GetResult\\(\\)', 'Task\\.WaitAll', 'Monitor\\.Wait']},
 20029	        {"id": "cs-data", "q": '查詢有沒有 N+1/SELECT * 進大表?大結果集有分頁、過濾聚合下推到資料層嗎?',
